  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul’s will, controlling a River of Time segment from a stone lotus island, triggers Dao Jiu Lang’s most powerful offensive killer move from the old deathmatch with Xi Yuan. Nine layers of blade light shoot from the suppressed river wave. If one layer breaks, another remains; each layer can slaughter ghosts and deities, then cycles back so each layer strikes nine times, eighty-one strikes in all. Dao Jiu Lang only used it three times in his lifetime, and every use consumed a hundred years of lifespan. The blade lights are extremely radiant like fragments of the sun. They bombard Lord Huang Shi until his yellow rock defense is gone, leave large injuries filled with blade path dao marks, and leave him haggard with almost no remaining defense.",
